The earlier solution missed the divisor \(13\) of \(351\), and therefore missed the factor pair \((13,27)\). This gives \(n=13+27-7=33\), for which the expression equals \(14^2\).

The full sum is \(345+113+41+33=532\), so the correct option is B.

